{number: 134}
{title: Lord, I’m Coming Home}
{key: Ab}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Ab] I've wandered far a-[Db] way from [Ab] God,
Now I'm coming [Eb7] home;
The [Ab] paths of sin too [Db] long I've [Ab] trod,
[Eb7] Lord, I'm coming [Ab] home.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Ab] Coming home, [Db] coming [Ab] home,
Nevermore to [Eb7] roam;
